    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vaulting Over It</strong> is a physics based, difficult climbing game where your mistakes are permanent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Based Vaulting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/95eb7f6af925ebb1400062fc44236258.poster.avif?t=1755276355\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/95eb7f6af925ebb1400062fc44236258.webm?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/95eb7f6af925ebb1400062fc44236258.mp4?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your branch is both your greatest ally and your worst enemy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Failing as a Feature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/056634c6a4d25b14a977d7077b9c0612.poster.avif?t=1755276355\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/056634c6a4d25b14a977d7077b9c0612.webm?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/056634c6a4d25b14a977d7077b9c0612.mp4?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying is the first step toward failure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/aecf55924b5fe3328a9195553f3fa327.poster.avif?t=1755276355\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/aecf55924b5fe3328a9195553f3fa327.webm?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/aecf55924b5fe3328a9195553f3fa327.mp4?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which only make things worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Map, No Checkpoints</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/142700bdcb3cf08e20e89dd6181a2fbe.poster.avif?t=1755276355\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/142700bdcb3cf08e20e89dd6181a2fbe.webm?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/142700bdcb3cf08e20e89dd6181a2fbe.mp4?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because who needs progress when you can start over... forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fully Physics-Driven Body</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/e5db6d8f8bfea1ce6cecfd944a08d32e.poster.avif?t=1755276355\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/e5db6d8f8bfea1ce6cecfd944a08d32e.webm?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/e5db6d8f8bfea1ce6cecfd944a08d32e.mp4?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It moves exactly how you tell it to, unfortunately.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vaulting Over It</strong> is a physics based, difficult climbing game where your mistakes are permanent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Based Vaulting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/95eb7f6af925ebb1400062fc44236258.poster.avif?t=1755276355\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/95eb7f6af925ebb1400062fc44236258.webm?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/95eb7f6af925ebb1400062fc44236258.mp4?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your branch is both your greatest ally and your worst enemy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Failing as a Feature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/056634c6a4d25b14a977d7077b9c0612.poster.avif?t=1755276355\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/056634c6a4d25b14a977d7077b9c0612.webm?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/056634c6a4d25b14a977d7077b9c0612.mp4?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying is the first step toward failure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/aecf55924b5fe3328a9195553f3fa327.poster.avif?t=1755276355\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/aecf55924b5fe3328a9195553f3fa327.webm?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/aecf55924b5fe3328a9195553f3fa327.mp4?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which only make things worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Map, No Checkpoints</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/142700bdcb3cf08e20e89dd6181a2fbe.poster.avif?t=1755276355\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/142700bdcb3cf08e20e89dd6181a2fbe.webm?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/142700bdcb3cf08e20e89dd6181a2fbe.mp4?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because who needs progress when you can start over... forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fully Physics-Driven Body</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/e5db6d8f8bfea1ce6cecfd944a08d32e.poster.avif?t=1755276355\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/e5db6d8f8bfea1ce6cecfd944a08d32e.webm?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/e5db6d8f8bfea1ce6cecfd944a08d32e.mp4?t=1755276355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It moves exactly how you tell it to, unfortunately.</p>",
